d that her father planted in her that  if rhaenyra ascends to this Throne her  son's lives will be in danger and as  annoying as the adult version of Allison  is revealing herself to be this does  make the stakes clear at least from her  perspective in her mind people who are  jocking for power will question renera's  claim based on her son's appearances and  that will give her a reason to eliminate  the other possible heirs I.E Allison's  children in the time since we last Saw  Damon grabbing his niece's face at the  wedding Feast he's married Lena Valerian  and they had twins named Bella and Reina  we catch up with them in pentos where  you get to sense that they're  celebrities due to their dragons and  Damon's exploits in the stepstones  there's a fun scene with him and his  wife riding their dragons where we see  just how big Veigar is their daughters  also had cradle Lakes but only Bayless  hatched this means that they have three  dragons in their little family at the  moment and this is worth an offer of a  free mansion and lands from the prince  of pentos if they're willing to relocate  and make themselves a deterrent for the  triarchy the couple is split on this  Damon likes the idea of the simple  transaction of riches in exchange for  the presence of their dragons Lena wants  her children to be raised with their  family according to their Birthright and  would rather have a dragon Rider's end  instead of growing old and fat in the  middle of nowhere after raniera listens  in on Lionel strong complaining to his  son about how his indiscretions with her  matter for their family and how it puts  them at risk we see that while Leonor is  mostly content with their agreement that  leaves him free to hang around the  palace enjoying the Finer Things in life  while partying with his lovers he's  heard about fighting going on in the  stepstones and that has him wanting to  get back out there to spice things up  Rainier won't hear a bit since after  Joffrey's birth