d this point things can really  take off and I think that's a great  place to leave things let me know in the  comments what you thought about this  episode and where things will go if you  haven't read the book and if you have  what did you think about the way things  are playing out they definitely move  some things around the timeline here and  it feels like a choice not to spend too  much time on Harwin and Lena so if you  want to talk book spoilers that's fine  just please add a couple line breaks put  them below the fold so that people won't  see them unless they want to please like  this video If you enjoyed it please  subscribe to my channel if you haven't  already and thanks for watching I'll  talk to you soon

